OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FEvening
OL,6,Fshowers in the north becoming confined
OL,7,Fto Lincolnshire coasts overnight.
OL,8,FLarge areas of dense fog forming again
OL,9,Fthis evening, along with some patches
OL,10,Fof frost.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FWidespread dense fog will be
OL,13,Fslow to clear on Monday, but some
OL,14,Fbright spells developing later.
OL,15,FCoastal showers mostly dying out in
OL,16,Fthe afternoon. Feeling cool,
OL,17,Fespecially where fog lingers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
