OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FDry
OL,6,Fstart Tuesday, after any early fog
OL,7,Fclears. Rain arriving later from the
OL,8,Fsouthwest. Wednesday a wet start but
OL,9,Fturning drier. Perhaps rather cloudy
OL,10,FThursday with isolated showers.
OL,11,FTurning cooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
